'''Isaac''' is the main [[character]] of the series, returning from the original ''The'' ''Binding of Isaac'' from 2011. He is the only character unlocked by default.

Isaac starts with three [[Red Heart container]]s and one {{e|Bomb}}. He will also start with {{i|The D6}} once it is unlocked (after defeating {{E|Isaac}} as {{C|???}}).

== Notes ==
* Isaac is the basic character, with average stats. Unlocking {{I|The D6}} is invaluable for him as it allows him to see many more items. See The D6's article for detailed tips.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|The D6}} that Isaac can start with does not increase the [[special item]] counter.

== Item Interactions ==
* {{i|Birthright}}: All new item pedestals cycle between two options. Previously seen items are unaffected.

